Alembic migrations for the Personal Media Companion backend.

Common commands (run from backend/, with the venv active and DATABASE_URL set):

  alembic upgrade head              # apply all migrations
  alembic revision --autogenerate -m "message"
  alembic downgrade -1              # roll back one
  alembic current                  # show applied revision

The deploy hook runs `alembic upgrade head` before starting the app
(see start.sh).
